`useScrollAnchor` keeps the visible content stable when items are **prepended**.
Before the DOM updates it records `scrollHeight`; after, in a
**`useLayoutEffect`**, it adds the difference to `scrollTop`. The gate prepends
ten messages and asserts the message that was at the top of the viewport is
**still** at the top, to the pixel.

